{"unit_id":"DEVbyQIN__dsh-sidebar-marks#caveat-1","repo":"DEVbyQIN/dsh-sidebar-marks","commit":"ec075240e58b71e4d36cc9a806da33dd844b31ba","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-marks 将标记保存在浏览器 localStorage 的 dsh.sidebar-marks.v1 键中，因此数据属于当前浏览器站点来源，不会由插件同步到其他浏览器。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:32-33","lib/client.js:486-501"]}
